    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_01_clerk_00",
      "hash64": "743806B7EE256EA4",
      "text": "¡Hola! Puedes pasearte por la sede de nuestro\\nequipo del Alto Mando todo lo que quieras.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_01_clerk_01",
      "hash64": "743807B7EE257057",
      "text": "¡Bienvenid[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa a la Plaza Polar, sede del equipo de\\nLevi del Alto Mando!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_01_clerk_02",
      "hash64": "743808B7EE25720A",
      "text": "Imagino que vienes a participar en calidad de\\naspirante de la Liga Arándano.\\c\\nA ver, te llamabas... [VAR 0x0100(0000)], ¿verdad?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 102,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_01_clerk_03",
      "hash64": "743809B7EE2573BD",
      "text": "Para afrontar el reto del Alto Mando deberás\\nabonar 50 PA. ¿Quieres hacer el pago ahora?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_01_dragonbb_01",
      "hash64": "4196A3A64BDC857D",
      "text": "¡Para el carro! ¿En serio le vas a hacer un feo así\\na mi colega?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_01_clerk_04",
      "hash64": "743802B7EE2567D8",
      "text": "¿L-Levi?... T-tenemos que acatar el reglamento...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_01_dragonbb_02",
      "hash64": "4196A0A64BDC8064",
      "text": "Qué reglamento ni qué leches... Mira, los pago\\nyo por [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0402)]élella y así todos contentos, ¿vale?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
